<title>SWEDEN: Average rate 4.75 pct on Swedish 1-yr T-bill.</title>
<headline>Average rate 4.75 pct on Swedish 1-yr T-bill.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted rate in an auction of one-year Treasury bills was 4.75 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The office had invited bids for a total of five billion crowns of one-year paper. It received 68 bids totalling 11.6 billion crowns, and the issue was fully allocated with 27 bids accepted.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
